// M5-A3P-1003. Ch18 §4 Ansedra (offered): CLOSED to heretics; the Kite can't land (act3_threads T-10,
// T-11). One scene from the air: Merel at a window of her father's house; a red thread on the sill. No rescue; the
// cost stays seen. No dialogue from Merel.
title: ch18_revisit_ansedra
location: ch18/kite
---
@letterbox on
@camera K22
@music silence fade=2.0
@wait 4.0
<<if $ch14_merel_taken>>
    @camera K23
    @wait 4.0
    Liss [grief]: That's her. That's Merel. #line:ch18_ansedra_001
    @wait 3.0
    Liss [sad]: She's tied a red thread on the sill. Her wedding colour. #line:ch18_ansedra_002
    @wait 4.0
<<endif>>
@letterbox off
===
